        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 6FBR 6 Inch Flush Bolt With Round Corners</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 6 Inch Flush Bolt (also know as an door edge bolt) is installed into the edge of the door and has a toggle lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. The Solid Brass 6 Inch Flush Bolt With Round Corners is often used on cabinet and furniture doors. Packaged complete with flush bolt, matching finish screws, and strike plate. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-6FBR.gif?v=1704354691\" width=\"600\" height=\"219\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 6FBR 6 Inch Flush Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-flush-bolts-with-square-corners-deltana-4fbs\">4\" Flush Bolt</a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-flush-bolts-with-square-corners-deltana-del-6fbs\">6\" Flush Bolt with Square Corners</a>  -  \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-stainless-steel-flush-bolt-deltana-6fbs32d\">6\" Stainless Steel Flush Bolt</a>  -  \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-7-inch-flush-bolt-deltana-7fbr\">7\" Flush Bolt</a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-extension-flush-bolts-12-18-and-24-inches-deltana-del-efb\">Extension Flush Bolts in 12\", 18\", 24\"</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Flush Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Corner: Round</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Thickness: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-6FBS.pdf?v=1691095313\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 6FBR Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 6 Inch Flush Bolts with Round Corners",
                "description": "The 6 Inch Flush Bolt (also know as an door edge bolt) is installed into the edge of the door and has a toggle lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. The Solid Brass 6 Inch Flush Bolt With Round Corners is often used on cabinet and furniture doors. Packaged complete with flush bolt, matching finish screws, and strike plate. Available in 9 different finishes.  \r\n",
                "keywords": "DEL-6fbr 6 Inch Flush Bolts, Deltana 6FBR 6 Inch Flush Bolt Round Corners, Deltana DEL-6FBR flush door bolts, flushbolts, heavy duty door bolts,  deltana flush door bolts,  6 inch round flush bolts, 6 inches door flush bolts, french door edge bolts, long door bolts,  lock french doors, french door locks, 6 inch edge door bolts, french door bolts, DEL-6FBR10B, DEL-6FBR15, DEL-6FBR15A, DEL-6FBR19, DEL-6FBR26, DEL-6FBR26D, DEL-6FBR3, DEL-6FBR5, DEL-6FBRCR003,"
